=== Sum of Digit Sums ===
S(10) = 46
S(100) = 901
S(1000) = 13501
S(10000) = 180001
S(100000) = 2250001

Verification:
S(1..9) = 45 (expected 45)
S(1..99) = 900 (expected 900)

=== Digit Sum of Answer ===
digit_sum(answer) = 77
